      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the outlets and everything seems fine, like there isnt even a flicker in the lights. it feels different though. like it isnt just a noise, it feels like my body is actually tuning into it. like i can feel the frequency. i read somewhere that sometimes people experience this when their neurobiology is shifting or something. do u think that's possible?",
